services_sep2.desc:
On-device CCOUNT microbenchmark for the IEEE 2030.5 (SEP2) codec (services/energy/sep2): the XML
resource builders - DeviceCapability, EndDevice, and a DERControl event. Pure string logic;
no transport.

services_wamp.desc:
On-device CCOUNT microbenchmark for the WAMP codec (services/iot/wamp): the JSON message builders
(HELLO / SUBSCRIBE / GOODBYE) and the array-element parser used to decode inbound messages. Pure;
the WebSocket transport is elsewhere.

services_ws_client.desc:
On-device CCOUNT microbenchmark for the WebSocket client codec (services/net/ws_client): the RFC 6455
handshake builder, the Sec-WebSocket-Accept derivation, and the masked frame build/parse. Pure;
the lwIP/TLS transport is out of scope.
